  <Properties>
    <Name>Horem's Aloe Vera bonus resource</Name>
    <Teaser>Add the bonus resouce Aloe Vera that spawns on flat desert tiles.</Teaser>
    <Description>Add the bonus resouce Aloe Vera that spawns on flat desert tiles.
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]+1 [ICON_GOLD] .
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]+1 [ICON_FOOD], +2 [ICON_RESEARCH] with Plantation.</Description>
